%% Everything here is Phase 6 or Phase 7 and appears in no published figure.
%% ---
%% STUDENT_TUTOR_PRACTICE_SETS has RLS enabled with NO POLICY AT ALL. That is deliberate and it
%% is the control that withholds practice answers: with no policy, the table is unreachable from
